/**
 * Makes the kate copy refuel at this point.
 * 
 * @param asEntityName, Name of Kate Copy robot
 * @param asRefuelAtEntity, The entity to refuel at. The positive z-axis must point where the robot will come to rest.
 * @param asRefuelDoneCallback, Called when refueling is done. Syntax: void Func(const tString&in asEntity);
 **/
